id: pm-fx80w2
title: Scale fixtures silently omit unregistered Story items from metadata reads
description: Point-read scale validation generated 10000 items but the SDK child scan read only 9019. The generator includes Story in its weighted type population without registering it in a fresh workspace. Earlier shape conformance measures constructed metadata instead of proving runtime readability. Register every generated type through the SDK and verify exact corpus counts before accepting scale evidence.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-05T09:47:08.719Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-05T12:49:37.631Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-05T11:14:18.105Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-05T11:14:18.105Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: Every generated type is registered in the generated workspace; SDK reads observe exactly the declared item count including Story; Regression test fails against the unregistered generator; Point-read scale evidence includes a complete explicit scan negative control
parent: pm-9rxu
resolution: Register every generated type and seed schema history under the reproducible process environment
expected_result: Generated metadata and complete SDK reads contain the same population
actual_result: 1500-row regression and 100000-row explicit scan are complete; 2243-row calibration now reads all 2243 rows
